# VITE_API_ORIGIN — full origin of the Nest API (no path). Example:
# VITE_API_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
#
# Leave unset during local dev to use Vite proxy: browser calls `/api/v1/...`
# and `vite.config.ts` forwards to `VITE_DEV_PROXY_TARGET` (default http://localhost:3000).
#
# VITE_DEV_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:3000
